{"$message_type":"diagnostic","message":"`text` does not live long enough","code":{"code":"E0597","explanation":"This error occurs because a value was dropped while it was still borrowed.\n\nErroneous code example:\n\n```compile_fail,E0597\nstruct Foo<'a> {\n    x: Option<&'a u32>,\n}\n\nlet mut x = Foo { x: None };\n{\n    let y = 0;\n    x.x = Some(&y); // error: `y` does not live long enough\n}\nprintln!(\"{:?}\", x.x);\n```\n\nHere, `y` is dropped at the end of the inner scope, but it is borrowed by\n`x` until the `println`. To fix the previous example, just remove the scope\nso that `y` isn't dropped until after the println\n\n```\nstruct Foo<'a> {\n    x: Option<&'a u32>,\n}\n\nlet mut x = Foo { x: None };\n\nlet y = 0;\nx.x = Some(&y);\n\nprintln!(\"{:?}\", x.x);\n```\n"},"level":"error","spans":[{"file_name":"/home/bat/projects/bream/evidence/rust-ownership-review/fixtures/borrow_escape.rs","byte_start":121,"byte_end":126,"line_start":3,"line_end":3,"column_start":60,"column_end":65,"is_primary":true,"text":[{"text":"fn main() { let text=String::from(\"owned\"); must_be_static(&text); }","highlight_start":60,"highlight_end":65}],"label":"borrowed value does not live long enough","suggested_replacement":null,"suggestion_applicability":null,"expansion":null},{"file_name":"/home/bat/projects/bream/evidence/rust-ownership-review/fixtures/borrow_escape.rs","byte_start":129,"byte_end":130,"line_start":3,"line_end":3,"column_start":68,"column_end":69,"is_primary":false,"text":[{"text":"fn main() { let text=String::from(\"owned\"); must_be_static(&text); }","highlight_start":68,"highlight_end":69}],"label":"`text` dropped here while still borrowed","suggested_replacement":null,"suggestion_applicability":null,"expansion":null},{"file_name":"/home/bat/projects/bream/evidence/rust-ownership-review/fixtures/borrow_escape.rs","byte_start":78,"byte_end":82,"line_start":3,"line_end":3,"column_start":17,"column_end":21,"is_primary":false,"text":[{"text":"fn main() { let text=String::from(\"owned\"); must_be_static(&text); }","highlight_start":17,"highlight_end":21}],"label":"binding `text` declared here","suggested_replacement":null,"suggestion_applicability":null,"expansion":null},{"file_name":"/home/bat/projects/bream/evidence/rust-ownership-review/fixtures/borrow_escape.rs","byte_start":106,"byte_end":127,"line_start":3,"line_end":3,"column_start":45,"column_end":66,"is_primary":false,"text":[{"text":"fn main() { let text=String::from(\"owned\"); must_be_static(&text); }","highlight_start":45,"highlight_end":66}],"label":"argument requires that `text` is borrowed for `'static`","suggested_replacement":null,"suggestion_applicability":null,"expansion":null}],"children":[],"rendered":"error[E0597]: `text` does not live long enough\n --> /home/bat/projects/bream/evidence/rust-ownership-review/fixtures/borrow_escape.rs:3:60\n  |\n3 | fn main() { let text=String::from(\"owned\"); must_be_static(&text); }\n  |                 ----                        ---------------^^^^^-  - `text` dropped here while still borrowed\n  |                 |                           |              |\n  |                 |                           |              borrowed value does not live long enough\n  |                 |                           argument requires that `text` is borrowed for `'static`\n  |                 binding `text` declared here\n\n"}
